10. "The Hidden Treasure" by Lisa Brown - Finally, if you're looking for a fun and adventurous read, then this tale of a young explorer searching for hidden treasure is sure to hit the spot. With its exciting action scenes and charming protagonist, you'll be rooting for her every step of the way. And at just $16.99, it's a great value too!</s>

